    "preamble": "Kalaiyarasan vs The Commissioner on 5 March, 2024 Author: G.R.Swaminathan Bench: G.R.Swaminathan W.P( BEFORE THE MADURAI BENCH OF MADRAS HIGH COURT DATED : 05.03.2024 CORAM THE HONOURABLE MR.JUSTICE G.R.SWAMINATHAN W.P(MD)No.4192 of 2024 and W.M.P.(MD)Nos.4045, 4048 & 4049 of 20224 Kalaiyarasan Vs. 1.The Commissioner, Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Drug, Administration Department, DMS Campus, 5th Floor, No.359 Annasalai, Teynampet, Chennai 600 006. 2.The Designated Officer, Tamil Nadu Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, Food Safety Wing, Trichy District. ... Prayer : Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of In praying this Court to issue a Writ of Certiorari, to call f pertaining to the impugned notice issued in 3087/Vu.Pa.Thu/Trichy/2023 dated NIL passed by the 2nd respondent and quash the same as illegal and unconstitutional. For Petitioners : Mr.B.Jameelarasu For Respondents : Mr.T.Villavankothai Additional Government Pleader https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/2 W.P(MD)N Kalaiyarasan vs The Commissioner on 5 March, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/24551105/ 1 G.R.SWAMINATHAN, ORDER",
